  "description": "NJEMU is an open-source emulator for classic Capcom and SNK arcade hardware. It started as a PSP project and now shares one C codebase across PSP, PlayStation 2, PlayStation Vita, and Desktop.\n\nThe project emulates:\n\nCapcom CPS1\nCapcom CPS2\nNeo Geo MVS/AES\nNeo Geo CD (NCDZ)\nNJEMU focuses on keeping the original low-memory console targets practical while sharing emulator policy, GUI code, rendering semantics, metadata, configuration, and tooling across platforms.",
